# expected number of names is MANIFEST_EXPECTED_FIXTURES in
# monitor/watcher/test-pane-state.sh. Adding or removing a fixture is a
# three-file edit: the fixture, this list, and that number. Without the
# number, a fixture and its line could be deleted together and the suite
# would still exit 0 under ALL TESTS PASSED, one assertion lighter.

